{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "133", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So New Zealand whitewash Bangladesh 3-0 in the T20I series. Bangladesh once again fail to register a win in the Kiwiland. Now, they will look forward to the Tests  and look to change their luck over there. They will hope that injuries to Kayes and Mortaza are not too serious and they would be available for the Tests. So tune in on 12th of January for the first Test between New Zealand and Bangladesh in Wellington at 0330 IST (1100 local). Till then, take care! Cheers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "132", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "COREY ANDERSON was named the Man of the Match for his superb unbeaten 94! He hit 10 sixes in that innings making a new record for a Kiwi batsmen.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "131", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "After an initial hammering from the visiting side, the Kiwi spinners pulled the game back on their side. Williamson continuously rotated his bowlers around which worked for him. Sodhi and Williamson did the damage in the middle overs by giving away just 31 runs in their 6 overs and scalped 3 wickets. Boult picked up a couple of wickets but proved to be very expensive. Santner was other successful bowler with a wicket to his name. Ben Wheeler bowled at good lines and lengths and gave away just 2 runs in the crucial 16th over.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "130", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The spinners then came into the attack and kept it tight. This got Sarkar frustrated and he lost his way by falling to Sodhi after a quick-fired 42. This opened the floodgates for the Black Caps as they didn't let any Bangladeshi batsmen to score freely. Shakib tried his best but there was no one on the other end to support him. He too then fell on 41. The visitors clearly missed Kayes and skipper Mortaza who didn't come out to bat after succumbing to injuries in the first innings.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "129", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Imrul Kayes was injured which led the way for Soumya Sarkar to open the innings. He did justice to that as he and Tamim Iqbal took full advantage of the fielding restrictions, taking bowlers to all parts of the ground. Tamim fell in the 5th over but Sarkar still carried on and ended the Powerplay on the score of 69/1.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "128", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "NEW ZEALAND HAVE WON BY 27 RUNS AND WIN THE SERIES 3-0! 69 runs off the last 5 overs were always going to be an uphill task for the visitors. And after scoring just 2 runs in the 16th over, they made it even more difficult for them. Mosaddek Hossain fell to Santner while Shakib kept on batting. Nurul was dropped on 0 by Williamson but it didn't matter much as the Tigers were way off the required run rate. To get 35 runs off Boult's last over was next to impossible and Shakib fell trying to get the impossible done. Wicket of Shakib improved Boult's figures a bit but not by much as he ended with a figures of 4-0-48-2!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.6", "Id": "127", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10219", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.5", "Id": "126", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10219", "Commentary": "FOUR.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.4", "Id": "125", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4371", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.3", "Id": "124", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "3782", "Commentary": "OUT c Corey Anderson b Trent Boult. Bangladesh have lost their sixth wicket.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "3782", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.2", "Id": "123", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10219", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.1", "Id": "122", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10219", "Commentary": "No run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "18.6